== Trivia ==
* The achievement for unlocking Tainted Eve is "The Curdled", a possible title for the character.
** To ''curdle'' is to "separate or cause to separate into curds or lumps", representing Eve's blood clot familiars.
* A blood clot is known by the game as a "BLOOD_BABY" in the modding API.
* Tainted Eve's card, {{P|III - The Empress?}} means light and truth, a reference to the original sin (consuming the fruit of knowledge of good and evil), but is also associated by some to miscarriage, referenced by the clots.
** This card is a play on the upright {{P|III - The Empress}} which summons the {{i|Whore of Babylon}} effect, her normal starting item.

